      "writtenOn": "2024-01-19T06:45:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We were storing and restoring it before, so I decided not to change this logic now as I\u0027m not sure how this would work if cr50 goes through deep sleep. Can deep sleep happen between TPM2_Startup and TPM2_Shutdown? If yes - we have to preserve it. If not - we can drop it, as they are expected to be volatile.",
